en.description:
On September 26, 2026, on behalf of the Boernerowo Society, we invite the residents of Bemowo to a full-day "Very Cultural Picnic" in the green areas by SP No. 150 (Thommeego St. 1), in the school's Sports Hall, and at the Local Activity Place at Sobczaka St. 5.

Participants will be able to enjoy, among others:

• artistic and photography workshops, including joint painting of the mural "The Future of Boernerowo";

• a meeting with local history, "forest bathing" and a karate demonstration;

• a rich workshop zone for children and families;

• a craft fair and neighborhood cafes with homemade baked goods;

• street theater workshops;

• a music stage with concerts and a dance party;

• a treasure hunt for the youngest "Read the Forest..." and an orienteering run "Around Boernerowo" combining sports with exploring the area.

